    {
      "id": "minimal-example",
      "kind": "content",
      "eyebrow": "具象锚点",
      "headline": "一个单神经元：手算一遍反向传播",
      "lead": "取 f = σ(wx + b)，损失 L = (f − y)²，从损失出发逐步回传梯度到 w 和 b。",
      "transition": "zoom",
      "notes": "这是全课最该慢下来的地方。前向：z = wx+b → a = σ(z) → L = (a−y)²。反向：dL/da = 2(a−y)，乘 da/dz = σ(z)(1−σ(z)) 得 dL/dz，再乘 dz/dw = x 得 dL/dw。每一步都是'上游梯度 × 局部梯度'。局部梯度只关心当前节点的输入输出关系，不需要知道整个网络长什么样——这就是模块化的力量。常见错误：学生常把 da/dz 和 dz/da 搞混，记住我们求的是'输出对输入'的导数，方向和前向一致。",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "sim",
          "engine": "widget",
          "html": "<style>\n  .bp {\n    background: var(--bg2);\n    border-radius: var(--radius, 12px);\n    padding: 16px 20px 18px;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    height: 100%;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 12px;\n  }\n  .stage-wrap {\n    flex: 1;\n    position: relative;\n    background: var(--card);\n    border-radius: var(--radius, 8px);\n    overflow: hidden;\n    min-height: 0;\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n  }\n  .stage-wrap svg {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    display: block;\n  }\n  .corner-readout {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 10px;\n    right: 14px;\n    font-family: var(--mono);\n    font-size: 10px;\n    color: var(--text2);\n    letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    text-align: right;\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n  .corner-readout .phase { color: var(--accent); }\n  .corner-readout .detail {\n    color: var(--ink);\n    font-size: 10px;\n    letter-spacing: 0;\n    margin-top: 2px;\n    max-width: 210px;\n  }\n  .controls {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 12px;\n  }\n  .controls button {\n    background: var(--card);\n    color: var(--ink);\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    border-radius: var(--radius, 6px);\n    padding: 7px 16px;\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    font-size: 13px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: all 120ms linear;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .controls button:hover:not(:disabled) {\n    border-color: var(--accent);\n    color: var(--accent);\n  }\n  .controls button:active:not(:disabled) {\n    transform: scale(0.96);\n  }\n  .controls button:disabled {\n    opacity: 0.35;\n    cursor: not-allowed;\n  }\n  .step-bar {\n    flex: 1;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n    justify-content: space-evenly;\n    height: 18px;\n    position: relative;\n    padding: 0 10px;\n  }\n  .step-bar::before {\n    content: '';\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 3px;\n    left: 6px;\n    right: 6px;\n    height: 1px;\n    background: var(--line);\n  }\n  .step-bar .tick {\n    width: 2px;\n    height: 6px;\n    background: var(--line);\n    transition: all 120ms linear;\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 1;\n  }\n  .step-bar .tick.major { height: 10px; }\n  .step-bar .tick.done { background: var(--text2); }\n  .step-bar .tick.active {\n    background: var(--accent);\n    height: 14px;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 5px var(--accent);\n  }\n  .step-num {\n    font-family: var(--mono);\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: var(--text2);\n    min-width: 44px;\n    text-align: center;\n    letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n  }\n  .step-num .cur { color: var(--accent); }\n  .node-bg {\n    fill: var(--card);\n    stroke: var(--line);\n    stroke-width: 1.5;\n    transition: fill 200ms cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1), stroke 200ms cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1);\n  }\n  .node-text {\n    font-family: var(--mono);\n    font-size: 15px;\n    fill: var(--ink);\n    text-anchor: middle;\n    dominant-baseline: central;\n    transition: fill 200ms linear;\n    pointer-events: none;\n    user-select: none;\n  }\n  .node.active .node-bg {\n    fill: var(--accent);\n    stroke: var(--accent);\n  }\n  .node.active .node-text { fill: var(--bg); }\n  .node.glow .node-bg {\n    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 7px var(--accent));\n  }\n  .edge {\n    stroke: var(--line);\n    stroke-width: 1.5;\n    fill: none;\n    transition: stroke 200ms cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1), stroke-width 200ms linear;\n  }\n  .edge.active {\n    stroke: var(--accent);\n    stroke-width: 2.5;\n  }\n  .val-label, .grad-label {\n    font-family: var(--mono);\n    font-size: 11px;\n    text-anchor: middle;\n    opacity: 0;\n    transition: opacity 250ms linear;\n    pointer-events: none;\n    user-select: none;\n  }\n  .val-label { fill: var(--ink); }\n  .grad-label { fill: var(--accent); }\n  .val-label.show, .grad-label.show { opacity: 1; }\n  .dir-arrow {\n    font-family: var(--mono);\n    font-size: 10px;\n    fill: var(--text2);\n    letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n    text-anchor: middle;\n    transition: fill 200ms linear;\n  }\n  .dir-arrow.active { fill: var(--accent); }\n</style>\n<div class=\"bp\">\n  <div class=\"stage-wrap\">\n    <svg id=\"graph\" viewBox=\"0 0 700 360\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\">\n      <text x=\"150\" y=\"22\" class=\"dir-arrow\" id=\"dir-fwd\">前向传播 →</text>\n      <text x=\"550\" y=\"22\" class=\"dir-arrow\" id=\"dir-bwd\">← 反向传播</text>\n\n      <line id=\"edge-x-mul\" class=\"edge\" x1=\"79\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"221\" y2=\"134\"/>\n      <line id=\"edge-w-mul\" class=\"edge\" x1=\"79\" y1=\"194\" x2=\"221\" y2=\"146\"/>\n      <line id=\"edge-mul-add\" class=\"edge\" x1=\"259\" y1=\"147\" x2=\"411\" y2=\"203\"/>\n      <line id=\"edge-b-add\" class=\"edge\" x1=\"258\" y1=\"282\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"218\"/>\n      <line id=\"edge-add-sigma\" class=\"edge\" x1=\"450\" y1=\"210\" x2=\"590\" y2=\"210\"/>\n\n      <g id=\"node-x\" class=\"node\">\n        <circle class=\"node-bg\" cx=\"60\" cy=\"80\" r=\"20\"/>\n        <text class=\"node-text\" x=\"60\" y=\"80\">x</text>\n      </g>\n      <g id=\"node-w\" class=\"node\">\n        <circle class=\"node-bg\" cx=\"60\" cy=\"200\" r=\"20\"/>\n        <text class=\"node-text\" x=\"60\" y=\"200\">w</text>\n      </g>\n      <g id=\"node-b\" class=\"node\">\n        <circle class=\"node-bg\" cx=\"240\" cy=\"290\" r=\"20\"/>\n        <text class=\"node-text\" x=\"240\" y=\"290\">b</text>\n      </g>\n      <g id=\"node-mul\" class=\"node\">\n        <circle class=\"node-bg\" cx=\"240\" cy=\"140\" r=\"20\"/>\n        <text class=\"node-text\" x=\"240\" y=\"140\">×</text>\n      </g>\n      <g id=\"node-add\" class=\"node\">\n        <circle class=\"node-bg\" cx=\"430\" cy=\"210\" r=\"20\"/>\n        <text class=\"node-text\" x=\"430\" y=\"210\">+</text>\n      </g>\n      <g id=\"node-sigma\" class=\"node\">\n        <circle class=\"node-bg\" cx=\"610\" cy=\"210\" r=\"20\"/>\n        <text class=\"node-text\" x=\"610\" y=\"210\">σ</text>\n      </g>\n\n      <text id=\"val-x\" class=\"val-label\" x=\"60\" y=\"45\">x = 2</text>\n      <text id=\"val-w\" class=\"val-label\" x=\"60\" y=\"236\">w = 3</text>\n      <text id=\"val-b\" class=\"val-label\" x=\"240\" y=\"326\">b = 1</text>\n      <text id=\"val-mul\" class=\"val-label\" x=\"240\" y=\"105\">= 6</text>\n      <text id=\"val-add\" class=\"val-label\" x=\"430\" y=\"175\">= 7</text>\n      <text id=\"val-sigma\" class=\"val-label\" x=\"610\" y=\"175\">≈ 0.999</text>\n\n      <text id=\"grad-sigma\" class=\"grad-label\" x=\"610\" y=\"246\">σ′ ≈ 0.0009</text>\n      <text id=\"grad-add\" class=\"grad-label\" x=\"430\" y=\"246\">∂L/∂add ≈ 0.0009</text>\n      <text id=\"grad-mul\" class=\"grad-label\" x=\"240\" y=\"176\">∂L/∂mul ≈ 0.0009</text>\n      <text id=\"grad-x\" class=\"grad-label\" x=\"60\" y=\"45\">∂L/∂x ≈ 0.0027</text>\n      <text id=\"grad-w\" class=\"grad-label\" x=\"60\" y=\"236\">∂L/∂w ≈ 0.0018</text>\n      <text id=\"grad-b\" class=\"grad-label\" x=\"240\" y=\"326\">∂L/∂b ≈ 0.0009</text>\n    </svg>\n    <div class=\"corner-readout\" id=\"readout\">\n      <div>步骤 <span id=\"r-step\">1</span>/10 · <span class=\"phase\" id=\"r-phase\">前向</span></div>\n      <div class=\"detail\" id=\"r-detail\">输入 x = 2</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"controls\">\n    <button id=\"prev\">← 上一步</button>\n    <div class=\"step-bar\" id=\"stepbar\"></div>\n    <span class=\"step-num\"><span class=\"cur\" id=\"s-cur\">1</span>/10</span>\n    <button id=\"next\">下一步 →</button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<script>\n  const state = { step: 1 };\n  const TOTAL = 10;\n\n  const stepData = [\n    { phase:'idle', nodes:[], edges:[], vals:[], grads:[], detail:'计算图全貌：x·w+b → σ' },\n    { phase:'forward', nodes:['x'], edges:['x-mul'], vals:['x'], grads:[], detail:'输入 x = 2' },\n    { phase:'forward', nodes:['w'], edges:['w-mul'], vals:['w'], grads:[], detail:'权重 w = 3' },\n    { phase:'forward', nodes:['b'], edges:['b-add'], vals:['b'], grads:[], detail:'偏置 b = 1' },\n    { phase:'forward', nodes:['mul'], edges:['mul-add'], vals:['mul'], grads:[], detail:'mul = x·w = 2×3 = 6' },\n    { phase:'forward', nodes:['add'], edges:['add-sigma'], vals:['add'], grads:[], detail:'add = mul+b = 6+1 = 7' },\n    { phase:'forward', nodes:['sigma'], edges:[], vals:['sigma'], grads:[], detail:'σ(7) = 1/(1+e⁻⁷) ≈ 0.999' },\n    { phase:'backward', nodes:['sigma'], edges:[], vals:[], grads:['sigma'], detail:\"σ′(z)=σ(1−σ) ≈ 0.0009\" },\n    { phase:'backward', nodes:['add'], edges:['add-sigma'], vals:[], grads:['add'], detail:'∂add/∂mul=1 → ∂L/∂mul ≈ 0.0009' },\n    { phase:'backward', nodes:['mul'], edges:['mul-add'], vals:[], grads:['mul'], detail:'∂mul/∂x=w=3 → ∂L/∂x ≈ 0.0027' },\n    { phase:'backward', nodes:['x','w','b'], edges:['x-mul','w-mul','b-add'], vals:[], grads:['x','w','b'], detail:'链式法则：∂L/∂x=σ′·1·w ≈ 0.0027' },\n  ];\n\n  const nodeIds = ['x','w','b','mul','add','sigma'];\n  const edgeIds = ['x-mul','w-mul','mul-add','b-add','add-sigma'];\n  const phaseLabel = { forward:'前向', backward:'反向', idle:'待机' };\n\n  function update() {\n    const s = state.step;\n    const data = stepData[s];\n\n    nodeIds.forEach(id => {\n      const el = document.getElementById('node-' + id);\n      el.classList.remove('active','glow');\n      document.getElementById('val-' + id).classList.remove('show');\n      document.getElementById('grad-' + id).classList.remove('show');\n    });\n    edgeIds.forEach(id => {\n      document.getElementById('edge-' + id).classList.remove('active');\n    });\n\n    data.nodes.forEach(id => {\n      const el = document.getElementById('node-' + id);\n      el.classList.add('active');\n      if (data.phase !== 'idle') el.classList.add('glow');\n    });\n    data.edges.forEach(id => document.getElementById('edge-' + id).classList.add('active'));\n    data.vals.forEach(id => document.getElementById('val-' + id).classList.add('show'));\n    data.grads.forEach(id => document.getElementById('grad-' + id).classList.add('show'));\n\n    document.getElementById('r-step').textContent = s;\n    document.getElementById('r-phase').textContent = phaseLabel[data.phase];\n    document.getElementById('r-detail').textContent = data.detail;\n    document.getElementById('dir-fwd').classList.toggle('active', data.phase === 'forward');\n    document.getElementById('dir-bwd').classList.toggle('active', data.phase === 'backward');\n    document.getElementById('s-cur').textContent = s;\n\n    document.querySelectorAll('.step-bar .tick').forEach((t, i) => {\n      t.classList.remove('active','done');\n      if (i + 1 < s) t.classList.add('done');\n      if (i + 1 === s) t.classList.add('active');\n    });\n\n    document.getElementById('prev').disabled = s <= 0;\n    document.getElementById('next').disabled = s >= TOTAL;\n  }\n\n  const stepbar = document.getElementById('stepbar');\n  for (let i = 1; i <= TOTAL; i++) {\n    const tick = document.createElement('div');\n    tick.className = 'tick' + (i === 1 || i === 6 || i === 10 ? ' major' : '');\n    stepbar.appendChild(tick);\n  }\n\n  document.getElementById('next').addEventListener('click', () => {\n    if (state.step < TOTAL) { state.step++; update(); }\n  });\n  document.getElementById('prev').addEventListener('click', () => {\n    if (state.step > 0) { state.step--; update(); }\n  });\n  document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n    if (e.key === 'ArrowRight' && state.step < TOTAL) { state.step++; update(); }\n    if (e.key === 'ArrowLeft' && state.step > 0) { state.step--; update(); }\n  });\n\n  update();\n</script>",
          "id": "b3_sim"
        },
