          "latex": "\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial a} &= 2(a - y) \\\\\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial z} &= \\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial a} \\cdot \\sigma'(z) \\\\\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial w} &= \\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial z} \\cdot x\\end{aligned}",
          "caption": "单神经元链式法则的三个核心梯度",
